    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d393-a7">

                <pb facs="0436" n="1114" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1114"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 1.</seg></opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of a document
                            addressed to the Daimios by the Gorogio, in regular council seated,
                            on</hi>
                        <date
                            ana="#date_conversion-issue-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="chinese-lunisolar" notAfter="1863-05-31T23:59:59+08:05"
                            notBefore="1863-05-01T00:00:00+08:05"><hi rendition="#italic">the</hi>
                                21<hi rendition="#italic">st day of the</hi> 3<hi
                                rendition="#italic">d moon</hi></date>, <hi rendition="#italic">at
                            his Imperial Majesty’s citadel, <placeName>Nijiju, in
                            Miako</placeName>.</hi></dateline></opener>
                <p>“The Taikuns return to Yedo is further postponed by order of his Imperial
                    Majesty.</p>
                <p>“As lately instructed by his Imperial Majesty, the jioo-ngoon’s
                    (commander-in-chiefs) official duties are in all respects, as heretofore,
                    confided to him by his Imperial Majesty.</p>
                <p>“If, therefore, all the daimios take the special direction of affairs in their
                    respective commands and trusts, his Imperial Majesty’s mind will be at rest.</p>
                <p><anchor n="*" xml:id="d393-f1"/> “It will depend upon circumstances how far his
                    Imperial Majesty may desire personally to take the conduct of the exterminating
                    war.”</p>
                <p>The foregoing is reverently received on Irminal, <hi rendition="#italic">i.
                        e.</hi>, the August.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>Name, <hi rendition="#italic">i</hi>. <hi rendition="#italic">e.</hi>,
                        TAIKUN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d393-f1" n="*" xml:id="d393-f1-content">
                <p>This sentence intimates that if the Taikun does not act so as to please his
                    Imperial Majesty, he will draw the sword himself and exterminate the
                    barbarians.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
